From: PowerPhone research platform <powerphone@csr460.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnose D5 playback handoff timing without recurring logs

Record playback-only monotonic timings around positive FMQ transfers and
native WRITEI calls. On an existing terminal write error, report the prior
successful transfer exit, inter-transfer gap, open/property/lease/gain
handling, and failed write duration. Close reports the maximum observed gap.
Successful transfers do not log or perform additional mixer operations.
Capture, buffer geometry, scheduler policy and terminal xrun behavior are
unchanged. This instrumentation does not recover, conceal or qualify faults.

